summary

Summary of changes, all in AdminDashboard.tsx and CashierPortal.tsx unless noted:

Student Management dropdown: added a real "Active" tab (filters strictly status === 'Active') alongside the existing "All" tab, and removed the separate Archive button/modal/state entirely (showArchiveModal, archiveStudent, archiveError).
Assign Students panel: search now only queries students in the target class's grade level, and no longer shows a full-roster preview — results only appear once you start typing.
Quarter Grading button: root cause was that grading_periods rows are never seeded for a new school year, so the old update() calls silently matched zero rows and never persisted. Switched to upsert() (using the school_year_id, quarter unique constraint I verified in the DB) so opening/closing a quarter always writes a row, even the first time.
Process Payment receipt print: added a .print-receipt class + @media print rule in index.css that hides everything except the receipt card when printing, and hid the action buttons/icon via print:hidden.
Payment History: the "Receipt No." column was showing a truncated payment UUID while the real admin-issued receipt number was mislabeled as "Reference" — swapped Receipt No. to show that value and removed the now-redundant Reference column/CSV field/receipt-modal line (in both the table and the View/Print Receipt modals).
Cashier Student Accounts table: removed the Grade column (and adjusted colSpans) since grade is visible via the view button.
npx tsc --noEmit and a full vite build both pass clean.




