Summary:

Duplicate parent credentials on second child — already fixed by an earlier commit (create-guardian-account edge function dedups by email; verified the deployed function on Supabase). No change needed.

Guardian search autofill swapping first/last name — found the actual bug: guardian names are stored as "Last, First Middle" (comma format), but splitStudentName assumed space-separated "First Middle Last" order, so the comma-joined string split incorrectly. Added splitGuardianFullName in AdminDashboard.tsx that parses the comma format correctly, and used it in fillContactFromGuardian. Also added relationship auto-detection: the search now joins student_guardians to find each guardian's most recent relationship, shows "(on file as Mother)" next to their name, and swaps the three buttons for one highlighted "Use as Mother/Father/Guardian" button — so the registrar no longer has to guess which one to click.

Cashier Payment Details not reflecting admin's tuition fee — the calculation logic was already correct, but tuitionFees/enrollmentFees were only loaded once at app login in App.tsx, so a cashier's already-open session wouldn't pick up fee changes an admin made afterward. CashierPortal.tsx now refetches fees straight from Supabase whenever the cashier switches tabs (including into Process Payment), so it always reflects the latest admin-configured amounts.

Student profile Guardian grid — renamed to "Parent/Guardian Information" in StudentPortal.tsx and split into Mother / Father / Guardian subsections, pulling from mother_info/father_info JSON (populated at enrollment). Shows "N/A" for whichever parent wasn't filled in, and always shows the designated guardian contact.

tsc --noEmit passes cleanly on all changes.




