All three Todos.md items are implemented and the project builds cleanly (verified pre-existing unused-var warnings are unrelated to this work). Summary:

Academic Placement Section dropdown (AdminDashboard.tsx): the Enrollment form's Section field is now a <select> populated from class_sections filtered by the chosen Grade Level — same source Class Management writes to — with a sensible fallback if a grade has no sections defined yet. Selecting a new grade resets the section to the first valid option.

Pending Enrollment → Cashier payment → Registrar confirmation (AdminDashboard.tsx, CashierPortal.tsx): removed the old self-certified "fee already paid" checkbox. New/transferee enrollments now submit with enrollments.status = 'pending' and no portal accounts yet, landing in a new "Pending Enrollment" grid right under Pending Re-Enrollments. Cashier's Process Payment restricts a pending student to the "Enrollment Fee" option only. Once the registrar verifies the receipt (via Receipts) and clicks Confirm Enrollment, it creates the student + parent portal accounts and shows their credentials.

Parent Portal per-child breakdown (ParentPortal.tsx): the Billing & Payments tab now shows the same "Tuition Payment Breakdown" grid (all children, per-child line items + totals) that the Dashboard already had, alongside the existing single-child stat cards/history.

Not tested against a live Supabase instance (no local dev server run) — worth walking the flow manually per the plan's verification steps before shipping, especially the cashier's "Payment For" gating and the confirm-enrollment account creation.




